[guard grunting]


00:11:08.004 --> 00:11:10.755
[dramatic music]


00:11:11.651 --> 00:11:13.347
Now how is this all possible?


00:11:14.051 --> 00:11:15.235
Good question.


00:11:15.907 --> 00:11:19.107
We have developed a
neurotechnology that allows you


00:11:19.203 --> 00:11:23.459
