You OK?


00:13:29.156 --> 00:13:32.675
[pensive music]


00:13:40.323 --> 00:13:42.147
I'm gonna have to
hold onto this, OK?


00:13:42.243 --> 00:13:43.747
You weren't supposed
to be here, but I,


00:13:43.843 --> 00:13:46.147
I think it's a good
thing you were.


00:13:46.244 --> 00:13:47.715
All right?
Yeah.


00:13:50.276 --> 00:13:52.900
